---

---

<section class="py-24 bg-surface-container-low" id="product">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-gutter-mobile md:px-gutter-desktop">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface">
        Poderosamente simple. Totalmente automatizado.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-on-surface-variant mt-4">
        Todo lo que necesitas para escalar tus ventas a través de WhatsApp sin
        aumentar tu equipo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-unit-md auto-rows-[320px]">
      <div
        class="md:col-span-8 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-8 ambient-shadow border border-border-technical flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-8 overflow-hidden relative group hover:border-primary/40 transition-colors"
      >
        <div class="flex-1 z-10 flex flex-col">
          <div
            class="bg-orange-light w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary"
              >psychology</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">
            Personalidad personalizada
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-6 flex-grow">
            Entrena a tu bot con la voz, el tono y el conocimiento específico de
            tu marca. Tus clientes no notarán la diferencia, pero tus ventas sí.
          </p>
          <a
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-primary hover:text-secondary font-semibold transition-colors mt-auto"
            href="#"
            >Ver cómo funciona <span
              class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">arrow_forward</span
            ></a
          >
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 relative hidden sm:block">
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-surface-container-low to-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg border border-outline-variant p-4"
          >
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div class="h-2 w-3/4 bg-primary rounded"></div>
              <div class="h-2 w-full bg-secondary rounded"></div>
              <div class="h-2 w-5/6 bg-orange-light rounded"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="md:col-span-4 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-8 ambient-shadow border border-border-technical flex flex-col group hover:border-primary/40 transition-colors"
      >
        <div
          class="bg-orange-light w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">extension</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">
          Integración simple
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-6 flex-grow">
          Conecta con tu CRM, inventario o pasarela de pagos actual en menos de
          5 minutos. Sin código requerido.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-auto flex justify-center gap-4">
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant"
              >dataset</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">sync_alt</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant"
              >forum</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="md:col-span-12 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-0 ambient-shadow border border-border-technical overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row"
      >
        <div class="p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div
            class="bg-orange-light w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary"
              >shopping_cart_checkout</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">
            Gestión de pedidos automática
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant max-w-lg">
            Desde la consulta inicial hasta el cierre de la venta y la
            confirmación de pago. El bot maneja todo el flujo transaccional y
            actualiza tu tablero Kanban en tiempo real.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-low min-h-[200px] relative p-6 flex items-center justify-center"
        >
          <div
            class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg w-full max-w-sm ambient-shadow p-4 border border-outline-variant"
          >
            <div
              class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 border-b border-surface-variant pb-2"
            >
              <span class="text-xs text-on-surface font-semibold"
                >Nuevos Pedidos</span
              >
              <span
                class="bg-orange-light text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs"
                >3</span
              >
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div
                class="bg-surface p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-primary ambient-shadow"
              >
                <div class="h-3 w-1/2 bg-surface-variant rounded mb-2"></div>
                <div class="h-2 w-1/3 bg-surface-container-highest rounded">
                </div>
              </div>
              <div
                class="bg-surface p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-secondary ambient-shadow"
              >
                <div class="h-3 w-2/3 bg-surface-variant rounded mb-2"></div>
                <div class="h-2 w-1/4 bg-surface-container-highest rounded">
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
